<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the $400,000 Kremlin Cup womens' tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-Barbara Schett (Austria) beat Osa Carlsson (Sweden) 1-6 6-0 6-4</p>
<p>4-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Sara Pitkovski (France) 6-4 7-6</p>
<p>Elena Makarova (Russia) beat Patti Schnyder (Switzerland) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>8-Katerina Studenikova (Slovakia) beat Kristie Boogert (Netherlands) 7-5 4-6 7-5</p>
<p>Elena Tatarkova (Ukraine) beat Tatyana Panova (Russia) 7-6 6-0</p>
<p>5-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Magdalena Grzybowska (Poland) 6-2 7-6 7-2</p>
<p>2-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Anna Kurnikova (Russia) 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
